{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">正在熱播中的無綫處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》備受關注，其中飾演「唐芯」的新晉小花李茵彤（Desta）憑著甜美演出與活潑性格成功圈粉。日前，李茵彤特別號召劇中「開心小棧」的多位年輕戰友，包括胡敏芝、侯雋熙及廖家爵，齊齊在 TVB 電視城內的各個角落大跳節奏感十足的「抖肩舞」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2607d750-f357-4aae-82c7-ca2cfd6e0354.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026UuZw8Hlwmm1787711877.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2607d750-f357-4aae-82c7-ca2cfd6e0354.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ed57c2db-288c-48e3-8b5f-f85d66408fcd.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Yz5LtQLuTZ1787711877.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ed57c2db-288c-48e3-8b5f-f85d66408fcd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後，李茵彤在社交平台上分享了這段洗腦短片，並幽默留言笑稱：「開心小棧同大家打個招呼🤌🏻特別鳴謝特別演出嘉賓😆」，盡顯其率真可愛的一面。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"469c32dc-0fae-4466-b6c4-0135f55645d6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026BdgXFi5MXt1787711877.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"469c32dc-0fae-4466-b6c4-0135f55645d6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T02:54:36.203043+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}